{"__q": {"t": "Пассивный залог — Сборник 2", "q": [{"s": "Change to passive: «Someone stole my bag.»", "o": ["My bag stole.", "My bag was stolen.", "My bag is stolen.", "My bag has stolen."], "e": "Пассивный залог употребляется, когда исполнитель неизвестен."}, {"s": "Complete: «The project ___ by the team last month.»", "o": ["is completed", "was completed", "completes", "completed"], "e": "Past Simple Passive."}, {"s": "Choose: «The documents must ___ today.»", "o": ["signed", "to sign", "sign", "be signed"], "e": "Модальный глагол + be + III форма."}, {"s": "Complete: «He ___ a prize last year.»", "o": ["was gave", "is given", "was given", "gave"], "e": "С глаголами с двумя дополнениями подлежащим может быть лицо."}, {"s": "Which is correct passive?", "o": ["The news is announcing.", "The news were announced.", "The news was announced.", "The news announced."], "e": "«News» считается существительным в единственном числе."}, {"s": "Complete: «This song ___ by millions of people.»", "o": ["is listened to", "listened", "is listening", "listens"], "e": "В глаголах с предлогом предлог сохраняется."}, {"s": "Choose: «The meeting ___ until next week.»", "o": ["postponed", "is postponing", "has been postponed", "has postponed"], "e": "Present Perfect Passive."}, {"s": "Complete: «Nothing ___ about it yet.»", "o": ["is doing", "did", "has done", "has been done"], "e": "Исполнитель не указывается."}, {"s": "Choose: «The thief ___ by the police.»", "o": ["catches", "is catching", "was caught", "caught"], "e": "Past Simple Passive."}, {"s": "Complete: «The new school ___ next year.»", "o": ["opens", "will open", "will be opened", "is opening"], "e": "Future Passive."}]}, "Passive Voice — 2-ci toplu": "Пассивный залог — Сборник 2"}